# ─── Vercel Serverless Proxy ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# The backend URL is used ONLY by the serverless proxy function (api/[...path].js).
# It is a server-side variable — NOT prefixed with VITE_, so it is never
# exposed in the client-side JavaScript bundle.
#
# For local development, point to your local backend:
BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
#
# For production, set this in Vercel Dashboard > Settings > Environment Variables
# to your actual backend server URL (e.g., http://<your-server-ip>:8000/api).
